<fieldset class="input-mode-panel"><legend>Input and automatic timing</legend><label for="input_mode">Input mode</label><select id="input_mode" name="input_mode"><option value="auto" selected>Automatic detection</option><option value="timestamped">Timestamped text</option><option value="plain">Plain text with automatic timing</option></select><div class="timing-grid" id="timing-options"><label>Start offset (seconds)<input name="start_offset" type="number" min="0" max="86400" step="0.1" value="0"></label><label>Caption duration (seconds)<input name="caption_duration" type="number" min="0.25" max="60" step="0.25" value="3"></label><label>Gap (seconds)<input name="caption_gap" type="number" min="0" max="10" step="0.1" value="0"></label></div><p class="auto-timing-warning"><strong>Estimated timing:</strong> Plain-text lines receive timestamps during SRT conversion. Review timing against the media before publishing.</p><p id="detected-mode" role="status" aria-live="polite">Mode will be detected from the editor content.</p></fieldset>